WEBVTT

00:01:28.829 --> 00:01:32.746
I've long been fascinated with the power
of vulnerability and impressed with

00:01:32.746 --> 00:01:34.329
the power of Bernier's insights.

00:01:34.829 --> 00:01:38.079
I'm excited to learn from her about the
nuances of vulnerability at work,

00:01:38.454 --> 00:01:40.704
especially in places where it seems risky.

00:01:42.663 --> 00:01:46.413
I will say from one interview to another,
I cannot stand small talk.

00:01:46.538 --> 00:01:49.371
I love conversations that
go deep right away,

00:01:49.829 --> 00:01:53.621
and you are the queen of going
deep and being vulnerable.

00:01:53.621 --> 00:01:56.996
So I feel like I feel like I have extra
permission to do that here.

00:01:57.204 --> 00:02:02.371
I'm the queen of vulnerability and I'm the
assistant queen of, like, boundaries.